OL,3,GNEWSA'Impatient' driver, 79, sentenced
OL,4,Aafter cyclist hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn "impatient" driver who broke a
OL,7,Fcyclist's collarbone when he
OL,8,Fdangerously overtook him on a country
OL,9,Flane has been given a suspended
OL,10,Fsentence.
OL,12,FJohn Rice, 79, was rushing home from a
OL,13,Ftennis game when he clipped the cyclist
OL,14,Fon a single-track lane in
OL,15,FNorthumberland in April 2023, Newcastle
OL,16,FCrown Court heard.
OL,18,FThe cyclist told the court he had been
OL,19,Fleft in "constant pain" and his whole
OL,20,Flife had changed.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
