OL,3,GNEWSA'Impatient' driver, 79, sentenced
OL,4,Aafter cyclist hurt
OL,5,
OL,6,FRice, a grandfather of "exemplary"
OL,7,Fcharacter and community standing, had
OL,8,Fdenied wrongdoing but was found guilty
OL,9,Fof causing serious injury by dangerous
OL,10,Fdriving. He was jailed for one year
OL,11,Fsuspended for 18 months and ordered to
OL,12,Fpay #4,830 in court costs.
